{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And he appeared as one who jests in the eyes of his sons-in-law.</b> Because he said to them, ״כִּי מַשְׁחִית ה׳ אֶת הָעִיר״ (Genesis 19:14), he mentioned the Name of mercy; therefore it seemed like jesting in their eyes, for they said: What — a name of mercy will destroy and waste? But the truth is indeed so, for the wicked turn the attribute of mercy into the attribute of judgment."], :book :genesis, :voice :kli-yakar, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:28:52.453555976Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}